  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Dashboard of Illicit Finance Vulnerabilities (ICE ODA Project)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project, led by Tax Justice Network with input from the University of Sussex, has three interlinked components. The first component will produce an update of bilateral and jurisdiction-level Illicit Financial Flows vulnerability assessments, based on secrecy and regulatory data and aggregate trade and investment flows. The second component will see the construction and analysis of granular datasets of investment stock values and network architectures in / by key countries and actors and concern. The final component will see the integration of FDI and sanctions datasets from component 2, with updated TJN IFF vulnerability assessment in component 1, to support fine-grained, targeted assessment of risks associated with IFFs from particular countries of interest</narrative>
  </description>
